[38;5;252m[1m## What the library is[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;10mc_src/src/lib.c[0m is a single translation unit: a [38;5;10mStringBuffer[0m (malloc'd [38;5;10mchar*[0m + [38;5;10mint capacity[0m + [38;5;10mint length[0m), a small operation dispatcher keyed on [38;5;10mstrcmp[0m, and [38;5;10mbuffapp[0m, which composes them and logs to stdout via [38;5;10mprintf[0m. Six exported functions; only [38;5;10mbuffapp[0m is declared in the header.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;252m[1m## Phase A artifacts ([38;5;10mtranslation/[0m)[0m[0m
[0m[0m
- **SYMBOLS.md** — all 6 C [38;5;10mT[0m symbols; all 6 exported by the Rust [38;5;10m.so[0m. Nothing was missing, so no wrapper had to be added and no module was untranslated.[0m[0m
- **ERRORS.md** — 22 rows, derived by grepping every [38;5;10mreturn NULL[0m / [38;5;10mreturn -1[0m / [38;5;10mreturn 0[0m sentinel, [38;5;10mswitch[0m default, and NULL guard. No asserts or error enums exist in this code.[0m[0m
- **CONFIGS.md** — 32 rows over 11 axes the C actually branches on (capacity shape, growth decision, caller-tampered [38;5;10mlength[0m/[38;5;10mcapacity[0m, the 5 [38;5;10mswitch[0m arms, the 5 [38;5;10mstrcmp[0m arms, the [38;5;10mb == 0[0m guard, the 7 distinct [38;5;10m% 4[0m residues per parameter, the [38;5;10mintermediate3 == 0[0m split).[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;252m[1m## Phases B–D[0m[0m
[0m[0m
60 differential scenarios, ~90k randomized calls from a fixed-seed splitmix64 PRNG, every call made through [38;5;10mdlsym[0m on both [38;5;10m.so[0m files. [38;5;10mbuffapp[0m's stdout is compared byte-for-byte, not just its return value. Faulting rows (NULL derefs, [38;5;10mINT_MIN / -1[0m) are run in re-exec'd children and compared by terminating signal, with a control case proving those rows aren't vacuous. Symbol parity and all feature combinations (there are no [38;5;10m[features][0m, derived mechanically) are checked by scripts.[0m[0m
